# NOTE: `tests/` and `docs/` used to be ignored here. They are not any more.
# Ignoring them meant the automated tests and every planning / API document
# existed on one laptop only and reached nobody on push — which for a graded
# group project is the opposite of what is wanted.
#
# postman/ is still partly ignored: the exported collections contain
# environment ids and bearer tokens from live sessions. regenerate.py rebuilds
# them from scratch, so nothing is lost by leaving them out.
postman/*.json

# local .env backups — never commit
.env.backup*
